    <briefdescription>
<para>Tanh cutoff function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><formula id="3">\[ f_c(r) = \begin{equation} \begin{cases} \tanh^3\big( 1 -\frac{r}{r_c} \big) &amp; \text{if } r \leq r_c\\ 0 &amp; \text{otherwise}\\ \end{cases} \end{equation} \]</formula></para>
<para>Behler, J. (2011). Atom-centered symmetry functions for constructing high-dimensional neural network potentials. <emphasis>J. Chem. Phys.</emphasis>, <emphasis>134</emphasis>(7), 074106. <ulink url="https://doi.org/10.1063/1.3553717">https://doi.org/10.1063/1.3553717</ulink> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
